  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safeguarding Access to Fiscal and Educational Resources Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective (PDO) are to support continued access to education and contribute to addressing sources of fiscal pressure emanating from the energy sector in Sao Tome and Principe.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will enable the continued delivery of services in the education sector by ensuring the payment of salaries to teachers and school administrators, and support critical activities in the energy sector that will further its sustainability and limit its negative fiscal impacts. By supporting the education sector, the proposed project directly addresses the highest expenditure for the state.</narrative>
  </description>
